# Testing
coverage/
# __tests__/ and the *.test.js / *.spec.js patterns used to be ignored here,
# which meant the directory jest's testMatch requires could never be committed —
# any test written was untrackable, and CI had nothing to run. Unignored so the
# authorization suite can live in the repo.
